00:16:05,752 --> 00:16:10,952
所以，我会更重视这几个比率，而不是那两个。
So, you know, I'm able to take this ratio, this ratio, this ratio more seriously than these two.

208
00:16:11,252 --> 00:16:13,052
实际上，控制点都集中在这里。
In fact, I got the points of controls here.

209
00:16:13,652 --> 00:16:15,452
我仍在寻找下跌趋势，
I'm still looking for a downtrend.

210
00:16:15,552 --> 00:16:17,152
仍在等市场进一步走低。
I'm still looking for the market to move lower.

